103
00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:10.900
Erica wrote in and said, is there a story to the origin of Michael Scott's name?

104
00:04:10.900 --> 00:04:16.600
There is a Michael Scott in Dante's Inferno, and I wondered if that inspired anyone in naming the character.

105
00:04:16.880 --> 00:04:18.300
Ooh, I love this question.

106
00:04:18.560 --> 00:04:19.020
I know.

107
00:04:19.280 --> 00:04:21.200
So, I reached out to Greg Daniels.

108
00:04:21.300 --> 00:04:22.840
It is not from Dante's Inferno.

109
00:04:23.060 --> 00:04:23.360
Okay.

110
00:04:24.120 --> 00:04:29.260
So, as you know, on the British show, the manager's name is David Brent, which is two first names.

111
00:04:29.460 --> 00:04:33.300
And that has become sort of a tradition in the various versions of the office.

112
00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:33.760
Yeah.

113
00:04:33.760 --> 00:04:39.320
But I was curious, how did Greg settle on the two names, Michael and Scott?

114
00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:41.040
He said this,

115
00:04:41.240 --> 00:04:49.420
My name is almost two first names, and there is something kind of lame I always felt in a funny way about having two first names and no last name.

116
00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:53.000
And Michael is a pretty generic name for our age group.

117
00:04:53.160 --> 00:04:54.700
There are a ton of Michaels.

118
00:04:54.700 --> 00:04:59.720
And I knew a guy named Scott, who was kind of a derp, so I just put them together.

119
00:05:05.290 --> 00:05:05.810
Derp.

120
00:05:05.930 --> 00:05:06.270
I know.

121
00:05:06.870 --> 00:05:08.650
I have never heard that.

122
00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:10.270
So, there you go, Erica.

123
00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:14.070
That is how Greg Daniels came up with the name Michael Scott.

124
00:05:14.590 --> 00:05:18.450
Well, my husband, Lee Kirk, has two first names.

125
00:05:19.030 --> 00:05:22.530
